.vercel-linux-site-packages/

# Root data/ raw source GeoJSON copies (large, regeneratable staging data).
# Deployed copies used by the app live in public/data/ and rag-backend/data/
# only — this pattern is anchored to the top-level data/ folder and does not
# touch those two directories.
/data/**/*.geojson
/data/docs/*.pdf

# GitHub upload exclusions for very large source artifacts
/data/admin/BND_ADM_DONG_PG.shp
/public/data/sigungu_boundary.geojson
/public/data/simulation_candidate_top30_v4.geojson
/rag-backend/data/docs/소나무재선충병 바로 알기(국립산림과학원).pdf

